      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Chain a multiple of 2. Row 1: dc in each ch to end. Turn." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Bullion row" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Row 2: ch 1, *dc in next dc, then bullion stitch in next dc (wrap yarn 10 times around hook, insert in stitch, draw up a loop, pull through all 11 loops on hook, ch 1 to secure); repeat from * across. Fasten off." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
